    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">typical influence on</rdfs:label>
    <txtcon:modellingNote xml:lang="en">Use this property for cross-module class-level or concept-level links such as process parameter to structural characteristic, structure to durability, or context factor to durability. It is intentionally an annotation property to avoid strong OWL inferences over classes.</txtcon:modellingNote>
